[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4082.309, "timestamp": "01:08:02", "text": "毎日、私は仕返しをします"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4084.15, "timestamp": "01:08:04", "text": "私は善行をしていることになるが、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4087.99, "timestamp": "01:08:07", "text": "誰かを褒めたり、誰かを褒めたり"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4092.069, "timestamp": "01:08:12", "text": "えーっと、あなたに感謝していますし"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4094.47, "timestamp": "01:08:14", "text": "すべて、またはあなたのために何か素敵なことをします"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4097.269, "timestamp": "01:08:17", "text": "それも私の一日を素晴らしいものにしてくれるでしょうし、私は"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4098.989, "timestamp": "01:08:18", "author": "@prathampro", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/7tcieem4yOUd9YXALarR3aYDlD62vnZzUlT_1QVJKtQgVzXDOl8byGd1-8hfYZmHnjbZGyS_5Uw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "true"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4100.95, "timestamp": "01:08:20", "text": "ええ、それで完全に満足するでしょう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4103.269, "timestamp": "01:08:23", "text": "たとえ私が他人のことを気にかけていて"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4105.135, "timestamp": "01:08:25", "author": "@prathampro", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/7tcieem4yOUd9YXALarR3aYDlD62vnZzUlT_1QVJKtQgVzXDOl8byGd1-8hfYZmHnjbZGyS_5Uw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "👏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4106.789, "timestamp": "01:08:26", "text": "他の人は優先権を持っていて、私にくれます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4109.51, "timestamp": "01:08:29", "text": "少なくとも少しは後退して、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4111.91, "timestamp": "01:08:31", "text": "そんな感じ。だから私は幸せになる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4116.709, "timestamp": "01:08:36", "text": "ええ、たとえ私が90％を投入したとしても"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4117.958, "timestamp": "01:08:37", "author": "@notpravinlol", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/t9UXLD6AmzS1-YItB_6_Kz4uAutM3H0oNxaU47_WUxq4oWNpbcDQvZiftO3UE0nS_-jgazDe=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "🫂"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4121.51, "timestamp": "01:08:41", "text": "他の人には10％を費やして、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4124.709, "timestamp": "01:08:44", "text": "良い一日を過ごせてよかった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4126.47, "timestamp": "01:08:46", "text": "多くのことが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4129.269, "timestamp": "01:08:49", "text": "一日で起こったことみたいなこと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4131.829, "timestamp": "01:08:51", "text": "意味がわからない、あなたがしたかどうかわからない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4134.07, "timestamp": "01:08:54", "text": "もちろんそうだったよ、もちろんそうだったよ"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4136.061, "timestamp": "01:08:56", "author": "@akamurajaizen", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/4TIH-D08DE7pk6l85RWWuj6VwP3lUitGX1m3JfDywIpryobVVVZSQqcm_MKVDuuN5keV4e0PSgU=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "joqi"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4136.749, "timestamp": "01:08:56", "text": "ニックのことを知っている人が何かを言っているなら"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4136.791, "timestamp": "01:08:56", "author": "@prathampro", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/7tcieem4yOUd9YXALarR3aYDlD62vnZzUlT_1QVJKtQgVzXDOl8byGd1-8hfYZmHnjbZGyS_5Uw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "u made sense"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4138.994, "timestamp": "01:08:58", "author": "@zergrush78319", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_nDwl-xtQg1-Z5v6Iv64Z42_Hei-15daYPmWXqoFR-4_b8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "to spend whole day playing stardew "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4139.749, "timestamp": "01:08:59", "text": "先輩、二度と言わないでください。私が"}]